{'symbol': 'TT', 'date': '2023-06-02 06:30:00', 'title': 'TRANE TECHNOLOGIES DECLARES QUARTERLY DIVIDEND', 'text': 'SWORDS, IRELAND--(BUSINESS WIRE)--THE BOARD OF DIRECTORS OF TRANE TECHNOLOGIES PLC (NYSE:TT), A GLOBAL CLIMATE INNOVATOR, DECLARED A QUARTERLY DIVIDEND OF $0.75 PER ORDINARY SHARE, OR $3.00 PER SHARE ANNUALIZED. THE DIVIDEND IS PAYABLE SEPTEMBER 29, 2023 TO SHAREHOLDERS OF RECORD ON SEPTEMBER 1, 2023. TRANE TECHNOLOGIES HAS PAID CONSECUTIVE QUARTERLY CASH DIVIDENDS ON ITS COMMON SHARES SINCE 1919 AND ANNUAL DIVIDENDS SINCE 1910. ABOUT TRANE TECHNOLOGIES TRANE TECHNOLOGIES IS A GLOBAL CLIMATE IN.'}